Bharata sets sandals on head and mounts chariot --- Vasiṣṭha and ministers lead east past Mandākinī --- Bharata circles Citrakūṭa and reaches Bharadvāja āśrama --- Bharata worships Bharadvāja and reports Rāma vow --- Bharata tells Vasiṣṭha sought sandals for Ayōdhyā welfare --- Bharata takes leave after Bharadvāja praises conduct --- Army returns by carts horses and elephants --- Bharata crosses Yamunā then Gaṅgā to Śr̥ṅgavērapura --- Bharata sights ruined joyless soundless Ayōdhyā
